Janus

This package contains data derived from the Unicode Character Database and from the
IDNA mapping table of UTS #46, version 17.0.0, copyright 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.,
distributed under the Unicode License v3. The files are vendored under
tools/Janus.UnicodeTables/ucd/ together with the licence text and the conformance test
file of UTS #46, and the tables generated from them are in src/Janus.Core/Unicode/.

This package contains the offline leaked-password list: the 100,000 most prevalent
SHA-1 hashes of Pwned Passwords, from Have I Been Pwned (https://haveibeenpwned.com),
drawn on 2026-09-26 over the range API. The list is in
src/Janus.Hosting/Passwords/leaked-passwords.txt, and tools/leaked-passwords/draw.py
draws it.

This package contains the English word list of the dictionary password source: the
3esl list of the 12dicts package, version 6.0.2, compiled by Alan Beale, who releases
the 12dicts lists to the public domain and asks that their use be acknowledged
(http://wordlist.aspell.net/12dicts/). The list is in
src/Janus.Hosting/Passwords/3esl.txt, and the build keeps its single lower-case words
of four letters or more.

This package contains the Public Suffix List, version 2026-09-24_13-26-36_UTC, from
https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat, downloaded on 2026-09-29. It is
subject to the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/) and is carried
unmodified, with its header, in src/Janus.Authentication/Factors/public_suffix_list.dat.
